@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@outfitId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010
@logId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000100

### 记录一次穿着
POST {{baseUrl}}/wear-logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outfit_id": "{{outfitId}}",
  "worn_on": "2026-11-19",
  "feedback": "liked",
  "notes": "通勤穿着，活动方便"
}

### 穿着记录列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/wear-logs
Accept: application/json

### 按搭配和日期范围筛选
GET {{baseUrl}}/wear-logs?outfit_id={{outfitId}}&start_date=2026-11-01&end_date=2026-11-30
Accept: application/json

### 记录详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/wear-logs/{{logId}}
Accept: application/json

### 完整更新记录
PUT {{baseUrl}}/wear-logs/{{logId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outfit_id": "{{outfitId}}",
  "worn_on": "2026-11-19",
  "feedback": "neutral",
  "notes": "补充当天的穿着感受"
}

### 删除记录
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/wear-logs/{{logId}}
